              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To stretch out? (ਪਸਾਰਨਾ, pasārnā.) To wake (someone) up? (ਜਗਾਉਣਾ, jagāuṇā.) Not busy? (ਵਿਹਲਾ, vihlā.) To lie down? (ਲੇਟਣਾ, leṭṇā.) In a hurry? (ਕਾਹਲਾ, kāhlā.) Ready? (ਤਿਆਰ, tiār.) A toothbrush? (ਬੁਰਸ਼, burash.) To shiver? (ਕੰਬਣਾ, kambṇā.) To shut a door? (ਭੇੜਨਾ, bheṛnā.) A walk? (ਸੈਰ, sair.) Hard to do? (ਔਖਾ, aukhā.) To rub? (ਮਲਣਾ, malṇā.) Lather? (ਝੱਗ, jhagg.) Grime? (ਮੈਲ, mail.) A tap? (ਟੂਟੀ, ṭūṭī.) To wring? (ਨਿਚੋੜਨਾ, nichoṛnā.) To dry something? (ਸੁਕਾਉਣਾ, sukāuṇā.) To hang up? (ਟੰਗਣਾ, ṭaṅgṇā.) A rope? (ਰੱਸੀ, rassī.) To wipe? (ਪੂੰਝਣਾ, pūnjhṇā.) A knot? (ਗੰਢ, gaṇḍh.) To tie? (ਬੰਨ੍ਹਣਾ, bannhṇā.) To tighten? (ਕੱਸਣਾ, kassṇā.) A cord? (ਡੋਰੀ, ḍorī.) A knotted cloth button? (ਘੁੰਡੀ, ghuṇḍī.) Roomy? (ਮੋਕਲਾ, moklā.) To take off? (ਲਾਹੁਣਾ, lāhuṇā.) To wrap? (ਲਪੇਟਣਾ, lapeṭṇā.) Loose trousers? (ਸੁੱਥਣ, sutthaṇ.) A hanging earring? (ਝੁਮਕਾ, jhumkā.) Oil? (ਤੇਲ, tel.) To braid? (ਗੁੰਦਣਾ, gundṇā.) A plait? (ਗੁੱਤ, gutt.) A hair tassel? (ਪਰਾਂਦਾ, parāndā.) A lock of hair? (ਲਟ, laṭ.)"
